' v1.2's map music, mode keep (`preset classic ai none seed 3 start 30 music remaster map_music 1`):
' the world map, Paradise Camp, its tent and back, Options and back. The log
' says what the playback does (`music: play`, `playlist`, `remember … @n`,
' `resume … @n`, `stop`). A scripted run is
' silent unless it names `music`; on the host SDL's dummy driver plays it.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
wait 60
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 120
mapclick 177,150         ' the tent: its song
wait 200
press escape             ' back on the map
wait 120
press o                  ' Options: the radio
wait 120
press escape             ' back
wait 120
quit
